    raw_spin_lock(&wqe->lock);
```
Reason:
The fix introduces a mechanism to cancel the pending work associated with the failed worker creation. By using `io_acct_cancel_pending_work()` with a match function, it ensures that only the specific work item is canceled, preventing potential execution by other workers and maintaining proper resource management. This approach addresses the root cause of the bug by ensuring that the request is safely cleaned up when worker creation fails.

